{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find My Frogs</strong> is a cozy hidden object game where you search for frogs and toads in a peaceful, hand-drawn village. Explore charming spots, uncover secrets, and help Uncle Froger gather everyone for a family photo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Explore</strong> the hand-drawn world of Moss Glade</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc38 <strong>Find</strong> 350+ Frogs and Toads</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Discover</strong> 60+ hidden secrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf19 <strong>Choose</strong> between day or night, or let time flow</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Relax</strong> in a soothing atmosphere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With calming animations and sounds, soothing music, and playful interactions - such as helping a little frog pick strawberries - <strong>Find My Frogs</strong> offers a sweet moment of serenity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Find My Frogs is a passion project by a duo of artists.</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Moss Glade","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3130800/79837cce6bb7fd2ea7a139bbb4fae52a22878395.jpg"},{"name":"Hazelnut House","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3130800/5769231fdb59436f31a76d3fdd0efe2f3742e948.jpg"},{"name":"Pantry","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3130800/70947e848db82b0dd998560454dcd2fe024bf980.jpg"},{"name":"Garden House","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3130800/414b2c3ecc0c9012ea6359a019628b1f370f6423.jpg"},{"name":"Music Studio","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3130800/41e2a09c8bd4320397ff71b6eb7bbd76b4374d93.jpg"},{"name":"Potion House","path":"ht